menu "AIFOM OTA security"

config AIFOM_OTA_SIGNING_KEY_SHA256
    string "Trusted OTA Ed25519 public-key PEM SHA-256"
    default ""
    help
        Lowercase SHA-256 hex digest of the exact PEM public key distributed
        by the trusted AIFOM firmware signing service. Stable firmware marked
        verification_required is rejected when this trust root is empty or
        does not match. Never learn this fingerprint from the OTA message.

endmenu
